shift-layout (1.0.0-3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Install layouts in the canonical xkeyboard-config-2 directory so custom
    files no longer block xkb-data's directory-to-symlink migration.
  * Require xkb-data with the new directory layout.
  * Add an optional Dell Dvorak keycode package for mixed internal Dvorak and
    external US keyboards under compositors with a shared keyboard layout.
  * Reload udev's hardware database and wait for remaps to reach input devices.
  * Ship the Plasma 6 mouse indicator explicitly and recommend its QML runtime.
  * Use explicit signal parameters in the Plasma 6 status reader.

 -- Florian Loitsch <florian@toit.io>  Fri, 23 Oct 2026 13:00:00 +0200

shift-layout (1.0.0-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add the optional mouse gesture proxy as a separate binary package.
  * Harden the root system service around input and uinput access.

 -- Florian Loitsch <florian@toit.io>  Thu, 17 Sep 2026 10:00:00 +0200

shift-layout (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add Debian packaging for the shifted XKB layouts and laptop remaps.

